<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Jitter Aim for all weapons in the game Apex Legends.

Use Sensitivity 2.1
Fov 95
Resolution 1920x1080

Works great with Volt and Flatline, but it reduces all weapons recoil by at least 85% - 90%</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
MoveR 0 0
Delay 5 12 ms
MoveR 7 2
Delay 5 12 ms
MoveR 1 2
Delay 5 12 ms
MoveR -3 -4
Delay 5 12 ms
MoveR -2 2
Delay 5 12 ms
MoveR -2 3
Delay 5 12 ms
MoveR 3 2
Delay 5 12 ms
MoveR -2 2
Delay 5 12 ms
MoveR 1 2
Delay 5 12 ms
MoveR -4 -3
Delay 5 12 ms
MoveR 3 -3
Delay 5 12 ms
LeftUp 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Apex Legends</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
